<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FORECAST - S.African company results consensus.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - S.African company results consensus.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>There are no major South African company results expected next week, other than December gold quarterly results from two mining firms.</p>
<p>These are Randgold and Exploration Co Ltd on Monday and Anglovaal Ltd on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
